tvh|n|The act of breaking, or state of being broken, especially by violence. ; A portion; a fragment. ; One or more aliquot parts of a unit or whole number; an expression for a definite portion of a unit or magnitude.	a:24d1,72,5;1wdh,69,9;20sa,69,3;168q,65,15;1x8n,59,15;168t,54,4;w53,16,3~168q,65,15;1x8n,59,15;1wdh,69,9;24d1,72,5;168t,54,4;w53,16,3;20sa,69,3
