tzz|v|To become congealed by cold; to be changed from a liquid to a solid state by the abstraction of heat; to be hardened into ice or a like solid body. ; To become chilled with cold, or as with cold; to suffer loss of animation or life by lack of heat; as, the blood freezes in the veins. ; To congeal; to harden into ice; to convert from a fluid to a solid form by cold, or abstraction of heat. ; To cause loss of animation or life in, from lack of heat; to give the sensation of cold to; to chill.	o:286o,37,4~286o,37,4	D:286o,17,1~286o,17,1
